r is a close-quarters fighting weapon.<br> Because you attack with kicks and punches, you can have a fast-paced battle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825410/extras/9ceb8e6bbc12acef5772d1508fef5099.poster.avif?t=1755160002\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825410/extras/9ceb8e6bbc12acef5772d1508fef5099.webm?t=1755160002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825410/extras/9ceb8e6bbc12acef5772d1508fef5099.mp4?t=1755160002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
